title: "Wind-hydrogen foresight models"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Strategic MILP and tactical block-wise LP models for sizing and operating a
  hydrogen system attached to a grid-connected wind farm under limited foresight.
keywords:
  - wind-hydrogen system
  - electrolysis
  - foresight horizon
  - mixed-integer linear programming
